            "title": "Overview of Relativity",
            "bullets": [
              "Developed by Albert Einstein",
              "Two main theories: Special and General Relativity",
              "Fundamental concepts: Space and time are interwoven"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "layout": "TwoColumn",
          "content": {
            "left": {
              "title": "Special Relativity",
              "bullets": [
                "Applies to observers in uniform motion",
                "Key postulates: Speed of light is constant"
              ]
            },
            "right": {
              "title": "General Relativity",
              "bullets": [
                "Incorporates acceleration and gravity",
                "Describes gravity as curvature of spacetime"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
